<title>USA: Home Depot names Arthur Blank CEO.</title>
<headline>Home Depot names Arthur Blank CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Depot Inc said on Wednesday it named Arthur Blank chief executive.</p>
<p>Blank, 54, retains his previous titles as president and chief operating officer.  Bernard Marcus, 68, who had been chief executive, remains chairman of the board and of the board's executive committee, the company said in a news release.</p>
<p>Home Depot operates 540 stores throughout North America.</p>
</text>
